33
00:02:26,639 --> 00:02:31,335
Covering a comparison of five pilot
provinces, and reviewing groundwater

34
00:02:31,335 --> 00:02:35,379
banks as one option depending on
the suitability of each area.

35
00:02:35,460 --> 00:02:39,696
Its policy recommendations
stress provincial water data

36
00:02:39,696 --> 00:02:43,777
centres, data integration
between agencies, community

37
00:02:43,777 --> 00:02:47,858
participation, and prioritising
projects and budgets.

38
00:02:48,860 --> 00:02:53,703
The Livestock and Fisheries subcommittee
is gathering and analysing data

39
00:02:53,703 --> 00:02:58,479
