sector and academic institutions.

40
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:05,220
It plans a study visit to Uthai
Thani from 12 to 13 November.

41
00:03:05,300 --> 00:03:11,522
To study the management of a stray dog
shelter, animal population control,

42
00:03:11,522 --> 00:03:16,399
